--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tools bothy installs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

bothy does not bundle, vendor, or redistribute any of the tools it sets up.
It downloads official release binaries from their own projects and verifies
them against checksums recorded in bothy.lock. Each remains under its own
licence, held by its own authors:

    zellij      https://github.com/zellij-org/zellij
    yazi        https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi
    lazygit     https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit
    delta       https://github.com/dandavison/delta
    ripgrep     https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep
    fd          https://github.com/sharkdp/fd
    fzf         https://github.com/junegunn/fzf
    zoxide      https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide
    jq          https://github.com/jqlang/jq

Yazi plugins are installed with Yazi's own package manager from
https://github.com/yazi-rs/plugins and likewise are not vendored here.

Ghostty (https://ghostty.org) is never installed by bothy; it is a host
application bothy detects, advises on, and hands a config file to.
